asr-000130
00:58:35.680 --> 00:58:40.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As we have emphasized during the DBCC briefing, our fiscal space is limited.

asr-000131
00:58:41.220 --> 00:58:47.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya kailangan talagang piliin natin, nating mabuti kung saan mapupunta ang bawat piso ng ating budget.

asr-000132
00:58:48.360 --> 00:58:53.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This becomes even more important given the economic challenges confronting our country.

asr-000133
00:58:53.960 --> 00:58:57.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We continue to feel the effects of external shocks,

asr-000134
00:58:57.460 --> 00:58:58.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: including the conflicts,

asr-000135
00:58:58.640 --> 00:58:59.380
