01:29:03.040 --> 01:29:04.500
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: to verify

asr-000896
01:29:04.500 --> 01:29:05.480
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: whether you are

asr-000897
01:29:05.480 --> 01:29:06.160
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: that person

asr-000898
01:29:06.160 --> 01:29:07.280
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: utilizing

asr-000899
01:29:07.280 --> 01:29:07.980
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: demographic,

asr-000900
01:29:08.900 --> 01:29:09.340
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: of course,

asr-000901
01:29:09.920 --> 01:29:10.900
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: and biometrics.

asr-000902
01:29:11.460 --> 01:29:12.600
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, yung ibang ID kasi,

asr-000903
01:29:12.840 --> 01:29:13.760
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: demographic lang yun.

asr-000904
01:29:13.900 --> 01:29:14.540
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, pwede natin

asr-000905
01:29:14.540 --> 01:29:15.140
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: ma-fake.

asr-000906
01:29:15.480 --> 01:29:15.980
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But yung

asr-000907
01:29:16.500 --> 01:29:17.420
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: National ID,

asr-000908
01:29:17.880 --> 01:29:18.560
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: it captures

asr-000909
01:29:18.560 --> 01:29:19.560
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: both demographic

asr-000910
01:29:19.560 --> 01:29:21.040
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: and biometric.

asr-000911
01:29:21.560 --> 01:29:21.980
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Itong 2026,

asr-000912
01:29:22.740 --> 01:29:23.660
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: substantial po

asr-000913
01:29:23.660 --> 01:29:24.400
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: yung authentication

asr-000914
01:29:24.400 --> 01:29:24.980
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: na

asr-000915
01:29:24.980 --> 01:29:25.960
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: gamitin.

asr-000916
01:29:25.980 --> 01:29:26.840
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ginamit yung

asr-000917
01:29:26.840 --> 01:29:27.520
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: National ID,

asr-000918
01:29:28.000 --> 01:29:28.960
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: both for government

asr-000919
01:29:28.960 --> 01:29:30.960
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: and private

asr-000920
01:29:30.960 --> 01:29:31.620
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: authentication,

asr-000921
01:29:32.280 --> 01:29:33.700
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: 114 million

asr-000922
01:29:33.700 --> 01:29:34.880
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: from January

asr-000923
01:29:34.880 --> 01:29:37.100
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: to September 15

asr-000924
01:29:37.100 --> 01:29:38.940
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: ang nag-authenticate

asr-000925
01:29:38.940 --> 01:29:39.920
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: utilizing the

asr-000926
01:29:39.920 --> 01:29:40.800
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: National ID.

asr-000927
01:29:41.300 --> 01:29:42.340
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And the bulk of this

asr-000928
01:29:42.340 --> 01:29:43.440
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: are from the

asr-000929
01:29:43.440 --> 01:29:44.320
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: private sector,

asr-000930
01:29:44.880 --> 01:29:45.480
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: yung financial.

asr-000931
01:29:46.120 --> 01:29:47.620
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, the private sector,

asr-000932
01:29:47.760 --> 01:29:48.600
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: particularly the banks

asr-000933
01:29:48.600 --> 01:29:50.960
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: and financial agencies,

asr-000934
01:29:51.520 --> 01:29:53.880
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: feels that the National ID

asr-000935
01:29:53.880 --> 01:29:55.580
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: is the database itself.

asr-000936
01:29:55.980 --> 01:29:57.280
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: It's a clean,

asr-000937
01:29:57.480 --> 01:29:59.220
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: valid database

asr-000938
01:29:59.220 --> 01:29:59.700
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: of

asr-000939
01:29:59.700 --> 01:30:00.000
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: individuals.

asr-000940
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:19.960
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Kaya ginagamit nila ang ating national ID system for authentication. Either facial recognition or di kaya yung fingerprint. So we feel, although mayroon tayong delay per timetable, one, because of the COVID, medyo nahihirapan tayo din sa COVID.

asr-000941
01:30:19.960 --> 01:30:32.440
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But right now, ang ating projection sa authentication versus registration, kasi sa mga national ID ng ibang bansa, tinitingnan nila ilan ba yung nag-authenticate versus nag-register.

asr-000942
01:30:32.440 --> 01:30:49.440
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So ang ating projection ngayong taon, mga nasa 1.5 times na-registered. So that would be about 150 million. But as we progress, aabot tayo dapat sa mga 4 to 5 authentications per registered person.

asr-000943
01:30:49.960 --> 01:30:59.380
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So dapat mga nasa 4 million to 5 million per year. Yun po yung datos ngayon, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-000944
01:30:59.380 --> 01:31:17.260
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: On the question sa late registration, I agree sa observation. Ang registration kasi sa birth certificate, una, it's a universal right. Everybody, Pilipinos, must be registered.

asr-000945
01:31:17.260 --> 01:31:32.620
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: That's why the Philippine Statistics Authority is really putting program for the registration. Right now, Your Honor, ang ating registered persons, mga 97% of the total population.

asr-000946
01:31:33.340 --> 01:31:44.000
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So mayroon pa tayong mga 3% na hindi pa na-register. So multiply again by about 114 million, so mga 3.5 million pa ang hindi re-registrado. Substantial number ay nasa BARM.

asr-000947
01:31:44.340 --> 01:31:47.000
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: About half of the registered sa BARM.

asr-000948
01:31:47.260 --> 01:32:05.320
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Now, ito rin po, dahil may late registration tayo, hindi kasi natin pwedeng itigil yung late registration kasi kawawa naman yung mga Pilipino na wala silang birth certificate. But of course, may problem tayo na yung mga non-Filipinos that are registered.

asr-000949
01:32:05.320 --> 01:32:08.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mr. Chair, with the indulgence of [unclear], can I interject?

asr-000950
01:32:09.640 --> 01:32:10.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, sir.

asr-000951
01:32:10.140 --> 01:32:14.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sa late registration, kasi matagal na itong pinag-usapan ni Park sa mga previous hearings, I raised this question.

asr-000952
01:32:14.940 --> 01:32:17.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yung sa late registration, where will it end?

asr-000953
01:32:17.260 --> 01:32:29.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sabi mo, walang katapusan ito. Dapat meron. Dapat darating yung time na wala ng late registration. Sa ngayon kasi, ang tanong ko, so paano yung compliance sa personal appearance, paano nyo po in-implement sa late registration?

asr-000954
01:32:29.980 --> 01:32:42.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi dito nagkakaproblema eh. Maraming mga Chinese nationals, hindi lang Chinese nationals, even other nationals, nakakalusot na nakuha sila ng Filipino citizenship through late registration. So how can we avoid that?

asr-000955
01:32:42.220 --> 01:32:46.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sabi mo kasi, it will be ongoing yung late registration.

asr-000956
01:32:47.260 --> 01:32:55.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sa akin, the way I foresee it, sana magkaroon ng stop. Sa ngayon pa lamang siguro, I suggest, magkaroon tayo ng tinatawag ng amnesty na I'll give you one year. Lahat. Dapat.

asr-000957
01:32:56.380 --> 01:33:04.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Lahat ng registration by after a year, tapos na. And then the following year, tablado na lahat and then umpisa na tayo from scratch.

asr-000958
01:33:04.860 --> 01:33:15.940
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Tama po yun, Your Honor, Senator. Mayroon nga ang PSA na proposal for the President to issue an executive order para kunin na natin itong, ano na lang, konti na lang, 3% of our population.

asr-000959
01:33:17.260 --> 01:33:28.640
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Na para lumabas sila at yung mga fees, kasi minsan may mga hand runs sa late registration, may mga bayad, na para wala na talagang bayad.

asr-000960
01:33:28.780 --> 01:33:41.340
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And nag-introduce ang PSA two years ago, Your Honor, Senators, ng isang step para magkaroon nga ng personal appearance. At yun yung registration sa national ID.

asr-000961
01:33:41.340 --> 01:33:46.100
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So we issued a memo that if you are a late registrant sa birth certificate,

asr-000962
01:33:47.260 --> 01:33:53.080
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: you must have to appear so that the national ID team can get your biometric and demographic.

asr-000963
01:33:53.600 --> 01:34:01.480
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But I agree with you, Senator Raffy, na kailangan talaga may time limit para at least makover yung substantial percentage.

asr-000964
01:34:01.500 --> 01:34:07.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So in that way, wala ba kayong plano na hanggang kailan matapos itong registration system natin?

asr-000965
01:34:07.440 --> 01:34:15.180
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: We have actually a program, Your Honor, Senator, yung birth registration assistance program at nabawasan po kasi noong 2020,

asr-000966
01:34:15.180 --> 01:34:22.900
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: ang ating late registration ay mga close to 4 million. And since then, we're able to register about 600,000.

asr-000967
01:34:23.040 --> 01:34:29.240
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Hinahanap namin sila, pababa na rin naman yung number of unregistered.

asr-000968
01:34:29.520 --> 01:34:38.180
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And as I've mentioned, the PSA actually proposed to the Office of the President for an issuance of an executive order, precisely yung sinabi ninyo,

asr-000969
01:34:38.180 --> 01:34:42.620
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: na parang one year para supportahan lahat, lalabas yung mga hindi registered.

asr-000970
01:34:42.760 --> 01:34:45.180
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But at least after that, konti na lang talaga yung...

asr-000971
01:34:45.180 --> 01:34:48.260
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: yung unregistered individuals natin. Your Honor, thank you.

asr-000972
01:34:50.640 --> 01:35:00.700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sir Chairman, yeah. Yusef Gad, Dennis, how many more national and local government units or agencies use their own IDs?

asr-000973
01:35:01.500 --> 01:35:04.440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yung baka nakakonsolidate sa national ID.

asr-000974
01:35:04.440 --> 01:35:14.680
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Okay. May mga agencies na gumagamit ng kanilang ID pa rin, Your Honor. Pero yung gamit, sabi ko nga kanina, yung gamit kasi ng national ID,

asr-000975
01:35:15.180 --> 01:35:25.320
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: the authentication. So for example, yung mga social protection programs natin, like 4Ps, lahat sila, ang ginagamit na database is the national ID database.

asr-000976
01:35:25.740 --> 01:35:32.460
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: At yung iba pa, like Dolly 2Pod, we started also, na authenticated sila using the national ID database.

asr-000977
01:35:32.460 --> 01:35:39.760
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Kasi nakikita namin kung may mga duplicates eh, because of your biometrics. So doon nakikita na ikaw pala yun.

asr-000978
01:35:40.120 --> 01:35:44.460
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And as we discussed, sa mga social protection program, we really encourage that...

asr-000979
01:35:45.180 --> 01:35:51.960
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: the agency will utilize as the database, the national ID database, because of the biometric authentication.

asr-000980
01:35:52.600 --> 01:36:02.660
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Now, does the PSA have any effort to purge yung ating system of yung mga pictures or dubious?

asr-000981
01:36:03.440 --> 01:36:13.820
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes, duplicate. Not only duplicate, yung nakapremise doon sa data registration na dubious yung pag-acquire ng national ID.

asr-000982
01:36:13.820 --> 01:36:14.820
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000983
01:36:15.180 --> 01:36:22.240
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yes, Your Honor. Yung una muna, doon sa late registration ng non-Filipinos, the PSA is very proactive.

asr-000984
01:36:22.520 --> 01:36:24.300
Senator Panfilo Lacson: How many have already been purged?

asr-000985
01:36:24.400 --> 01:36:33.820
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: About 1,600 po yung nabigay, nablock na namin sa system at automatically pinapadala namin sa Office of the Solicitor General.

asr-000986
01:36:33.820 --> 01:36:37.820
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Kasi po yung cancellation ng birth certificate ay talagang through court.

asr-000987
01:36:38.860 --> 01:36:44.920
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And that's why mayroon tayong CRBS, Civil Registration of Vital Statistics.

asr-000988
01:36:45.180 --> 01:36:56.540
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: We have a bill in the Senate and we are actually requesting, kasi may provision kaming nire-request na administrative cancellation na lang yung subvert registration.

asr-000989
01:36:56.660 --> 01:36:58.680
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Kasi may hirap po talaga pag-court.

asr-000990
01:36:59.000 --> 01:37:04.020
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But we are already, automatically may investigation tayong ginagawa through PSA.

asr-000991
01:37:04.460 --> 01:37:08.660
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And then once ma-establish namin na hindi talaga ito Pilipino, we block them.

asr-000992
01:37:08.720 --> 01:37:10.560
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And we have blocked so far, close to 1,600.

asr-000993
01:37:10.560 --> 01:37:14.560
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Can you submit to the committee the list of those...

asr-000994
01:37:15.180 --> 01:37:17.900
Senator Panfilo Lacson: late registration cases na na-purge nyo na?

asr-000995
01:37:18.620 --> 01:37:20.620
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So we can pursue further investigation?

asr-000996
01:37:21.380 --> 01:37:22.400
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000997
01:37:22.940 --> 01:37:27.840
Senator Panfilo Lacson: To deal with these people and those responsible behind the late registration.

asr-000998
01:37:28.080 --> 01:37:32.080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Because this is a big, you know, scam ito, di ba?

asr-000999
01:37:32.180 --> 01:37:32.460
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes.

asr-001000
01:37:32.880 --> 01:37:38.720
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Alam nyo rin naman, we've heard of 500,000 pesos per late registration of birth and so forth and so on.

asr-001001
01:37:38.720 --> 01:37:45.160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But I'm more particularly concerned about the national security issue.

asr-001002
01:37:45.180 --> 01:37:52.660
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi kung may mga sleeper agents, mga sales dito, delikado tayo, di ba?

asr-001003
01:37:53.300 --> 01:37:57.920
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And we're talking of thousands or even tens of thousands of these people.

asr-001004
01:37:58.620 --> 01:38:00.500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Well, you can just imagine.

asr-001005
01:38:01.640 --> 01:38:02.500
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001006
01:38:02.780 --> 01:38:08.880
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Every time we have the data on block, tawag namin doon block kasi binablock namin sa system,

asr-001007
01:38:08.880 --> 01:38:13.900
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: this information are shared with our national security agencies,

asr-001008
01:38:14.060 --> 01:38:15.040
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: including po yung Bureau.

asr-001009
01:38:15.180 --> 01:38:15.760
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001010
01:38:15.760 --> 01:38:19.560
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But we can provide the Senate, the committee, on the names po.

asr-001011
01:38:19.620 --> 01:38:19.740
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes.

asr-001012
01:38:20.100 --> 01:38:27.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Earlier on, kasi nagkaroon ng issue, I was called by dating Secretary Carl Chua

asr-001013
01:38:27.220 --> 01:38:33.300
Senator Panfilo Lacson: because there seemed to be a problem with the PILSIS number.

asr-001014
01:38:34.060 --> 01:38:37.760
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi sa batas, nakalagay on its face, di ba?

asr-001015
01:38:37.760 --> 01:38:44.500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But I think I was told that the World Bank had some concerns about data privacy.

asr-001016
01:38:45.180 --> 01:38:47.000
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So tinago natin yung PILSIS number,

asr-001017
01:38:47.560 --> 01:38:54.740
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ang nakalagay sa ating card, on its face, yung temporary or not the real PILSIS number.

asr-001018
01:38:56.000 --> 01:38:56.600
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Di ba?

asr-001019
01:38:56.760 --> 01:38:57.180
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-001020
01:38:57.720 --> 01:38:59.440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So how do we resolve that?

asr-001021
01:38:59.480 --> 01:38:59.700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay.

asr-001022
01:38:59.940 --> 01:39:08.240
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang promise ko sa kanya noon, maybe we need to amend the law para maalis yung on its face.

asr-001023
01:39:08.620 --> 01:39:14.580
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi I agree that the PILSIS number should be hidden somewhere.

asr-001024
01:39:14.580 --> 01:39:16.480
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero binibigyan niyo maliit na card eh.

asr-001025
01:39:16.560 --> 01:39:17.580
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yung iba, nawala na eh.

asr-001026
01:39:18.540 --> 01:39:21.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ako ay, you know, milagaw sa notes ko eh.

asr-001027
01:39:22.700 --> 01:39:25.280
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kaya memoryado ko yung aking PILSIS number.

asr-001028
01:39:25.420 --> 01:39:34.920
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But how about those who lost that piece of paper and what they only have is the temporary or the not the PILSIS number?

asr-001029
01:39:35.600 --> 01:39:36.100
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yun ang problema.

asr-001030
01:39:36.100 --> 01:39:42.020
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yung nakalagay, tama po kayo, Your Honor, Senator, yung nakalagay dun sa ating card, ano?

asr-001031
01:39:42.360 --> 01:39:44.420
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yung what we call the PILSIS card.

asr-001032
01:39:44.580 --> 01:39:44.700
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yung PILSIS number.

asr-001033
01:39:45.160 --> 01:39:46.860
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But tokenized po yan siya.

asr-001034
01:39:47.040 --> 01:39:51.680
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ibig sabihin at the back end, nakalink po siya dun sa ating PILSIS number.

asr-001035
01:39:52.120 --> 01:39:57.600
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But I agree, baka dun sa ating proposed amendment to the PILSIS Act,

asr-001036
01:39:58.500 --> 01:40:03.380
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: ayusin na lang natin na hindi dapat naka-expose yung PILSIS number.

asr-001037
01:40:03.460 --> 01:40:04.740
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Kasi siya lang po yung mag-isa talaga.

asr-001038
01:40:04.800 --> 01:40:06.500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Otherwise, we keep violating the law.

asr-001039
01:40:07.080 --> 01:40:07.980
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: In a way po.

asr-001040
01:40:08.180 --> 01:40:10.740
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Pero nandoon naman po, wala ka print siya.

asr-001041
01:40:10.740 --> 01:40:11.500
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yeah.

asr-001042
01:40:12.700 --> 01:40:14.520
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi kung offline,

asr-001043
01:40:14.580 --> 01:40:15.480
Senator Panfilo Lacson: hindi na makikita.

asr-001044
01:40:16.440 --> 01:40:17.820
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Pag offline na authentication,

asr-001045
01:40:17.920 --> 01:40:21.680
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: ginagawa lang po namin ngayon na mag-introduce kasi may bago namang technology.

asr-001046
01:40:21.860 --> 01:40:24.900
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: In fact, one of the section dun sa PILSIS Act is the introduction of technology.

asr-001047
01:40:25.260 --> 01:40:29.260
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Pwede na pong ma-link pa rin kahit na offline authentication, Your Honor.

asr-001048
01:40:29.540 --> 01:40:31.580
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Now, another common violation of the law,

asr-001049
01:40:32.300 --> 01:40:36.060
Senator Panfilo Lacson: yung the requirement of a second ID.

asr-001050
01:40:36.060 --> 01:40:42.060
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hindi lahat ng transactions with the government agencies as well as private institutions,

asr-001051
01:40:42.700 --> 01:40:44.400
Senator Panfilo Lacson: pumapayag na yung,

asr-001052
01:40:44.580 --> 01:40:45.740
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ah, singular ID.

asr-001053
01:40:46.080 --> 01:40:47.140
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nangingin na second ID.

asr-001054
01:40:47.240 --> 01:40:48.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And I'll read to you, ah, section 19,

asr-001055
01:40:49.360 --> 01:40:50.080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: penal provision.

asr-001056
01:40:51.160 --> 01:40:52.480
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Meron ditong, ah,

asr-001057
01:40:52.880 --> 01:40:56.500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: pag hindi tinanggap without just and sufficient cost,

asr-001058
01:40:57.360 --> 01:41:02.420
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ah, shall refuse to accept, acknowledge, and or recognize the PIL ID or PSN.

asr-001059
01:41:03.060 --> 01:41:04.160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Subject to authentication.

asr-001060
01:41:05.100 --> 01:41:05.920
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Meron ditong,

asr-001061
01:41:05.920 --> 01:41:09.720
Senator Panfilo Lacson: shall be fined in the amount of 500,000 pesos.

asr-001062
01:41:09.720 --> 01:41:13.320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, I don't think this is being implemented, no?

asr-001063
01:41:13.700 --> 01:41:14.380
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Because of the,

asr-001064
01:41:14.380 --> 01:41:16.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ah, failure, ah, in the implementation.

asr-001065
01:41:17.280 --> 01:41:18.300
Senator Panfilo Lacson: In the full implementation.

asr-001066
01:41:19.320 --> 01:41:19.500
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yeah.

asr-001067
01:41:19.760 --> 01:41:21.700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And I don't want this to be a dead letter law.

asr-001068
01:41:22.500 --> 01:41:28.480
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ah, sa ngayon po, ah, Your Honor, yung, ah, ah, Senator, yung aming strategy, ah, una, ah,

asr-001069
01:41:28.660 --> 01:41:32.520
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: first, yung datos natin, yung mga hindi tumatanggap, bumababa na yung number.

asr-001070
01:41:33.100 --> 01:41:34.800
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, nung simula kasi mataas talaga.

asr-001071
01:41:34.960 --> 01:41:40.780
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Pero ngayon, kasi every month po, tinatrack namin ito from the field offices and feedback mechanism,

asr-001072
01:41:41.180 --> 01:41:41.880
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: bumababa na siya.

asr-001073
01:41:42.260 --> 01:41:44.360
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ang aming munang, ah, Your Honor, Senator, is, ah,

asr-001074
01:41:44.380 --> 01:41:47.600
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: discussion, particularly with the regulatory agency,

asr-001075
01:41:47.840 --> 01:41:49.440
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: in particular, Banko Sentral ng Pilipinas.

asr-001076
01:41:49.920 --> 01:41:53.920
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, every time may mga financial, ah, institutions tayo na hindi tumatanggap,

asr-001077
01:41:54.240 --> 01:41:57.220
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: we, ah, we write the BSP and report them.

asr-001078
01:41:57.720 --> 01:42:01.760
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ah, yung mga agencies naman, ah, na government agencies, yun sa lahat na namin,

asr-001079
01:42:02.180 --> 01:42:05.980
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: ah, ang mga naiwan na lang ngayon, ah, Your Honor, Senator, yung mga nasa probinsya.

asr-001080
01:42:06.300 --> 01:42:09.820
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, yung mga rare na nakikita namin, it's in the province.

asr-001081
01:42:09.820 --> 01:42:14.260
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Siguro baka yung hindi nabasa yung memo, but we are, ah, ah, putting in, ah,

asr-001082
01:42:14.260 --> 01:42:16.000
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: a strong information campaign on this.

asr-001083
01:42:16.720 --> 01:42:20.760
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, encouragement muna ngayon, ah, Your Honors, ah, Mr. Senator, yung aming ginagamit.

asr-001084
01:42:20.760 --> 01:42:24.860
Senator Panfilo Lacson: I'm not sure if you're at liberty to, ah, inform the committee at this point, ano,

asr-001085
01:42:25.080 --> 01:42:29.380
Senator Panfilo Lacson: but I heard, during the initial phase of the implementation, medyo nagkagulo

asr-001086
01:42:29.380 --> 01:42:32.200
Senator Panfilo Lacson: because meron niya tanakialam sa kontrata.

asr-001087
01:42:34.480 --> 01:42:40.420
Senator Panfilo Lacson: The, ah, without giving any details, ano, would you confirm that?

asr-001088
01:42:40.660 --> 01:42:44.220
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ah, we had, ah, sa operation siguro, ah, Your Honor, ah, Senator,

asr-001089
01:42:44.260 --> 01:42:48.920
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: ang, ang operations natin na nagkaroon tayo ng problema is the printing of the physical card before.

asr-001090
01:42:49.380 --> 01:42:53.440
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, ah, but, but this was, ah, settled already, ah, two years ago.

asr-001091
01:42:53.660 --> 01:42:58.160
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: We, ah, withdraw, ah, from the memorandum of agreement with the Bank of Central Pilipinas

asr-001092
01:42:58.160 --> 01:43:02.380
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: because the service provider was not able to deliver as promised.

asr-001093
01:43:02.720 --> 01:43:05.880
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And, ah, we are now, ah, starting with a new service provider.

asr-001094
01:43:06.040 --> 01:43:09.560
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, kung may problem po, ah, yun siguro naisip ko na, na problem.

asr-001095
01:43:10.420 --> 01:43:14.100
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, without, you know, without giving details, more or less, you admit,

asr-001096
01:43:14.260 --> 01:43:17.120
Senator Panfilo Lacson: no, nagkaroon ng, ah, glitches.

asr-001097
01:43:17.500 --> 01:43:23.440
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ah, yeah, glitches, pero, ah, I'm not, I'm not, ah, about, about the, ah, issue on the contract.

asr-001098
01:43:23.520 --> 01:43:24.940
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But there was a glitch on the printing.

asr-001099
01:43:24.940 --> 01:43:28.280
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Narinig ko major glitch yun, eh, kasi meron nakasingit, eh.

asr-001100
01:43:29.380 --> 01:43:30.100
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ah, yung...

asr-001101
01:43:30.100 --> 01:43:30.980
Senator Panfilo Lacson: You're there already, di ba?

asr-001102
01:43:31.960 --> 01:43:33.380
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Di, ah, ano, siguro, ah...

asr-001103
01:43:33.380 --> 01:43:35.300
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Siguro marami nagpapasin itong batas, eh.

asr-001104
01:43:35.440 --> 01:43:37.220
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yes, ah, yes, eh.

asr-001105
01:43:37.240 --> 01:43:37.880
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And you would know.

asr-001106
01:43:38.260 --> 01:43:39.360
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ang, ang, ang, ah...

asr-001107
01:43:39.360 --> 01:43:39.960
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Never mind, never mind.

asr-001108
01:43:40.020 --> 01:43:41.080
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Yeah, what, what I can...

asr-001109
01:43:41.080 --> 01:43:41.840
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Nakaintindihan na tayo.

asr-001110
01:43:42.100 --> 01:43:43.660
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Okay, thank you very much, ah, Your Honor.

asr-001111
01:43:43.660 --> 01:43:44.240
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001112
01:43:44.260 --> 01:43:45.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

asr-001113
01:43:45.240 --> 01:43:53.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just to add doon sa [unclear] ni Senator Lacson, some agencies are requiring two, di ba?

asr-001114
01:43:53.540 --> 01:43:54.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Two government IDs.

asr-001115
01:43:55.540 --> 01:44:00.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's the, the, is this, ang, ang, rason ba dahil wala tayong signature doon sa PhilSys natin?

asr-001116
01:44:00.800 --> 01:44:01.940
Senator Panfilo Lacson: I'm sorry, ano, if I may add.

asr-001117
01:44:02.460 --> 01:44:03.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, please.

asr-001118
01:44:03.100 --> 01:44:04.160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: That was beyond his control.

asr-001119
01:44:04.720 --> 01:44:05.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: O nga.

asr-001120
01:44:05.380 --> 01:44:07.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ede, pero yun ba ang, isa, ibang isa sa rason?

asr-001121
01:44:07.840 --> 01:44:08.920
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yung glitch na sinabi ko.

asr-001122
01:44:08.940 --> 01:44:09.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ah, glitch, okay.

asr-001123
01:44:09.900 --> 01:44:10.760
Senator Panfilo Lacson: I'm not a member of that.

asr-001124
01:44:11.260 --> 01:44:12.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, just to clarify.

asr-001125
01:44:12.220 --> 01:44:12.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

asr-001126
01:44:13.340 --> 01:44:14.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba, yung ano, ano...

asr-001127
01:44:14.220 --> 01:44:17.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is it the reason yung dahil walang pera may, walang signature?

asr-001128
01:44:17.500 --> 01:44:20.520
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Maraming mga rason na nangyayari, ano.

asr-001129
01:44:20.600 --> 01:44:27.580
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Una, Your Honor, first, any new na iniintroduce natin may mga adjustments talaga.

asr-001130
01:44:28.120 --> 01:44:33.220
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And sabi ko nga, we agree at the start talagang mataas yung ating, mataas yung ating non-acceptance

asr-001131
01:44:33.740 --> 01:44:36.620
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: or nagre-require ng additional ID.

asr-001132
01:44:36.720 --> 01:44:42.960
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But the numbers, because we are tracking it, and we can share with you the monthly report that we have,

asr-001133
01:44:42.960 --> 01:44:44.880
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: it's going down.

asr-001134
01:44:45.360 --> 01:44:55.680
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And right now kasi, Your Honor, yung gamit ngayon ng national ID is really the authentication using facial recognition or the fingerprint.

asr-001135
01:44:56.020 --> 01:44:58.860
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: And yun yung ginagamit, like for example, yung mga fintech natin.

asr-001136
01:44:59.080 --> 01:45:00.040
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: So, that's not...

asr-001137
01:45:00.040 --> 01:45:02.140
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: require anymore the signature.

asr-001138
01:45:02.260 --> 01:45:03.840
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: But I have to admit that at the start,

asr-001139
01:45:04.200 --> 01:45:05.760
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: parang yun yung naging problema.

asr-001140
01:45:05.980 --> 01:45:07.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's why the others asked for

asr-001141
01:45:07.540 --> 01:45:08.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: other

asr-001142
01:45:08.920 --> 01:45:10.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: identification.

asr-001143
01:45:11.580 --> 01:45:14.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, Senator Kiko Pangilinan,

asr-001144
01:45:14.020 --> 01:45:14.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: then Senator Tulfo.

asr-001145
01:45:14.840 --> 01:45:17.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: If there is already a national

asr-001146
01:45:17.920 --> 01:45:19.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ID, why require

asr-001147
01:45:19.940 --> 01:45:20.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: two?

asr-001148
01:45:22.900 --> 01:45:23.460
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: That's

asr-001149
01:45:23.460 --> 01:45:24.580
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: why, Your Honor,

asr-001150
01:45:25.140 --> 01:45:27.440
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: the Banco Central as

asr-001151
01:45:27.440 --> 01:45:28.600
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: one of our partners,

asr-001152
01:45:28.600 --> 01:45:29.860
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: is very

asr-001153
01:45:29.860 --> 01:45:31.980
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: clear sa instruction.

asr-001154
01:45:32.920 --> 01:45:34.420
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Ang reading ko naman dito

asr-001155
01:45:34.420 --> 01:45:36.100
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: is that, as I said, the numbers

asr-001156
01:45:36.100 --> 01:45:38.240
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: of requiring

asr-001157
01:45:38.240 --> 01:45:39.980
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: two is now decreasing.

asr-001158
01:45:40.740 --> 01:45:42.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: For example, I understand, sorry.

asr-001159
01:45:43.200 --> 01:45:44.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The SEC

asr-001160
01:45:44.260 --> 01:45:45.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: requires two.

asr-001161
01:45:46.160 --> 01:45:47.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: If you register a new company,

asr-001162
01:45:48.540 --> 01:45:50.580
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: why two? Why not just a national

asr-001163
01:45:50.580 --> 01:45:50.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ID?

asr-001164
01:45:52.460 --> 01:45:53.140
PSA Undersecretary Claire Dennis S. Mapa: Di ba?

