asr-001602
02:01:19.100 --> 02:01:38.740
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: As you know, because the way we have been, we make decisions on importation and I think those quantitative restrictions are affecting the way the market functions.

asr-001603
02:01:38.740 --> 02:01:43.160
DEPDev Secretary Arsenio M. Balisacan: So the market can't effectively function.

asr-001604
