Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It has not been two years after.

asr-001637
02:04:17.920 --> 02:04:19.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: More than two years.

asr-001638
02:04:20.000 --> 02:04:20.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi 2004.

asr-001639
02:04:21.540 --> 02:04:26.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So 2024, 2025, 2026 na ngayon.

asr-001640
02:04:26.860 --> 02:04:29.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And I believe it was July 2024.

asr-001641
02:04:30.220 --> 02:04:31.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So that's a concern.

asr-001642
02:04:31.920 --> 02:04:35.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Now, just some...

asr-001643
02:04:35.240 --> 02:04:40.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung 9.7% poverty levels, how did that happen?

asr-001644
